first request OTP

curl -X POST http://localhost:5150/api/member/auth/send-otp \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"phone": "0532423078"}'

verify otp - check logs for the debug otp

curl -X POST http://localhost:5150/api/member/auth/verify \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"phone": "0532423078", "code": "528918"}'
